# The in-game video options clicked through (docs/phase-script.md, stage SC5; it replaces --video-check): zerg01's
# first view, F10, O and V open the video dialog by their keys, then each choice is clicked where the dialog shows it.
# After each, check video-choice wants the option's value and the world's art following it (an HD variant's scale or
# the original's, the HD sprites lit or not); a choice the player cannot have (no HD data) stays disabled and changes
# nothing. Each is logged and shot. Cancel puts every option back; HD (2x) and OK keep it and count one commit.
# tools/ci.sh wants exit code 0 and "0 failures". The real clock: the HD pages load on threads.
mission zerg/zerg01
options originals
clock real

wait game
wait frames 90
mark start
log start video.graphics video.fog video.water video.font video.lighting gamma portraits video.serial video.commits art.scale art.fx art.lit
shot start
key F10
wait dialog gamemenu
key O
wait dialog options
key V
wait dialog video
choose graphics.hd2
wait frames 45
check video-choice
log hd2 video.graphics video.fog video.water video.font video.lighting gamma portraits video.commits art.scale art.fx art.lit hd.ui
shot hd2
choose graphics.hd
wait frames 45
check video-choice
log hd video.graphics video.fog video.water video.font video.lighting gamma portraits video.commits art.scale art.fx art.lit hd.ui
shot hd
choose lighting.off
wait frames 45
check video-choice
log unlit video.graphics video.fog video.water video.font video.lighting gamma portraits video.commits art.scale art.fx art.lit hd.ui
shot unlit
choose lighting.on
wait frames 45
check video-choice
log lit video.graphics video.fog video.water video.font video.lighting gamma portraits video.commits art.scale art.fx art.lit hd.ui
shot lit
choose graphics.original
wait frames 45
check video-choice
log original video.graphics video.fog video.water video.font video.lighting gamma portraits video.commits art.scale art.fx art.lit hd.ui
shot original
choose fog.smooth
wait frames 45
check video-choice
log smooth-fog video.graphics video.fog video.water video.font video.lighting gamma portraits video.commits art.scale art.fx art.lit hd.ui
shot smooth-fog
choose water.animated
wait frames 45
check video-choice
log animated-water video.graphics video.fog video.water video.font video.lighting gamma portraits video.commits art.scale art.fx art.lit hd.ui
shot animated-water
choose font.vector
wait frames 45
check video-choice
log vector-text video.graphics video.fog video.water video.font video.lighting gamma portraits video.commits art.scale art.fx art.lit hd.ui
shot vector-text
# the gamma slider's track pages 10 a click: 100 to its 140 in five
click control video.1 right &
click control video.1 right &
click control video.1 right &
click control video.1 right &
click control video.1 right
wait frames 45
expect gamma == 140
log gamma gamma
shot gamma
choose portraits.still
wait frames 45
check video-choice
log still-portraits video.graphics video.fog video.water video.font video.lighting gamma portraits video.commits art.scale art.fx art.lit hd.ui
shot still-portraits
choose graphics.auto
wait frames 45
check video-choice
log auto video.graphics video.fog video.water video.font video.lighting gamma portraits video.commits art.scale art.fx art.lit hd.ui
shot auto
# Cancel: every option as at the start, back in the options menu
key C
wait dialog options
wait frames 45
log cancelled video.graphics video.fog video.water video.font video.lighting gamma portraits video.commits art.scale art.fx art.lit hd.ui
shot cancelled
expect video.graphics == @start.video.graphics and video.fog == @start.video.fog and video.water == @start.video.water
expect video.font == @start.video.font and video.lighting == @start.video.lighting
expect gamma == @start.gamma and portraits == @start.portraits
# HD (2x) again, and OK keeps it: back in the game, one commit more
key V
wait dialog video
choose graphics.hd2
wait frames 45
key O
wait nodialog
wait frames 45
check video-choice
log kept video.graphics video.fog video.water video.font video.lighting gamma portraits video.commits art.scale art.fx art.lit hd.ui
shot kept
expect video.commits == @start.video.commits + 1
